{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed3090c00fc0b8019e0df618ec7eefbd44527fa60a2dc611cad34ade7d94d02d", "ja": "（今日はアイドルゴルフ大会。優勝賞品はまだ秘密\nだが……実は、単独ライブ権が予定されている！）", "zh": "（今天是偶像高尔夫大赛。冠军奖品还在保密中，不过……其实，预定的奖品是单独演唱会的举办权！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2da4c42878efcc1e58f70a4b7811efccabcdd0b66b71ad9c29a4d5164c34a573", "ja": "おおっ、律子。ずいぶんいい調子みたいだな。\nこの調子でいけば優勝もありえるんじゃないか？", "zh": "哦，律子。看起来状态相当不错嘛。\n照这个势头下去，说不定能拿冠军吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "2555b6b9b1da4f4997537b540b7288a5842709145577d540428cc6db8620b3d9", "ja": "ふっふっふ。もちろんそのつもりですよ！\n優勝者には豪華賞品があるみたいですからね。", "zh": "哼哼哼。当然是这么打算的！\n听说冠军还能拿到豪华奖品呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "ffc565c269faef3c54d8626db7e515aced685df702ff504434a4d57355e77273", "ja": "でも、豪華賞品って結局なにが貰えるんだろ？\n{$P$}は知ってるんですよね。", "zh": "不过，豪华奖品到底能拿到什么呢？\n{$P$}应该知道吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "91ade057b2b65a118a7492dcbf816135f10420570cfe5099ac8e3d160f1c1949", "ja": "あー、それは…………。\nそうだな、律子が喜ぶものだよ。", "zh": "啊，那个嘛…………\n怎么说呢，是律子会喜欢的东西哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "066ae9b4ea6a7d2dcce9399a4debd019d3f15c70340c2e74fe80ca507f78c8d3", "ja": "えー、もったいぶらないでくださいよ。\nそんな言い方、ますます気になるじゃないですか。", "zh": "欸——别卖关子嘛。\n你这么一说，我就更在意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1c16145f7b4f0a58aaedfc97d161a885513033439857c42180caf1e24ba85629", "ja": "まぁ、優勝してからのお楽しみってことで。\n負けたら賞品もなにもないわけだからな。", "zh": "嘛，就当作获胜之后的惊喜吧。\n毕竟输了的话，就什么奖品都没有了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "95fd38185ad9378b6943b7498243afcae22450b0c64f0c1c8ae3f2fa88201c53", "ja": "ま、それもそうですね。でも私が喜ぶものか……。\nうーん、ゴルフの指南書……は、ちょっと地味かな。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。不过，我会喜欢的东西嘛……  \n嗯——高尔夫指南书……是不是有点太朴素了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "3085b3bc2d4f53050bde7acbefeb5d4813b9714b1500d8d3d3922f4d1184161a", "ja": "あとゴルフ関係なら、キャディバッグとか、\nいや、ここは敢えて特注の眼鏡フレームとか……！", "zh": "还有高尔夫相关的话，球包什么的……\n不对，这时候反而送个定制的眼镜框之类的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "927dc9ebfaa72c4b7d515e2124c0732ed9c83b1f9b590589c0ffa72eea8e2431", "ja": "うーん、やっぱり気になる！\nせめて少しだけ、ヒントだけでもくださいよ！", "zh": "嗯——果然还是很在意！\n至少给我一点点提示，就一点提示也好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1ab7f82ccfa7d2d0971b700cf7375598416396e9bfa0b74e2d053ed535a888e0", "ja": "まあ、気になりすぎて集中できないのも困るしな。\nそれじゃあ、ヒントだけ。", "zh": "嗯，太过在意也没法集中精神，确实不太好。\n那就只给你一点提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7ea57441c5742faf2369d441bf4647851263b59b21511d23308b92e51a7d65be", "ja": "律子個人というより、\nアイドル『秋月律子』が喜ぶプレゼントのはずだぞ。", "zh": "与其说是律子个人，\n倒不如说是偶像“秋月律子”会感到高兴的礼物哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "3f2ef3d0194734dfb16880ecb9694fce60dc77e3f9c8363a443210c9259a8df9", "ja": "なるほど、アイドルにとって……うーん。\nなんか、ますます気になってきましたね。", "zh": "原来如此，是对偶像来说……嗯。总觉得越来越在意了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f1e81535cbdfbd82e06e1868fae17952282f27cea06e996b223cdfd8fa4fb057", "ja": "ははは、これ以上は秘密だ。\n優勝して、是非自分の目で確かめてくれよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，接下来就保密了。\n请务必夺冠，亲眼确认一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "bcd0b44e41574ee60cd1d5c7daa0020b54c07019b5879349106cb7595829f475", "ja": "うぅ、気になりますけど、仕方ないですね。\nこうなったら、なにがなんでも優勝してみせます！", "zh": "呜，虽然很在意，但也没办法呢。\n既然这样，无论如何我都要拿下冠军给您看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0263_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "13745628a2a422ecaf2e0ebbf599bae21781b41217dd50ad656e581c91baaeed", "ja": "よ～し、それじゃ、次のホールに移動しましょうか。\n私のクラブ捌き、見ててくださいね！", "zh": "好～，那么我们移动到下一个球洞吧。\n请看好我的挥杆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
